== Trivia ==
* Hornfel will sometimes taunt Isaac by sticking out his tongue while sending out his decoy dummies.
* [[Wikipedia:Hornfels|Hornfels]] is the group name for a set of contact metamorphic rocks. They are known to be very hard and durable.
* {{e|The Horny Boys}} are a stitched amalgamation of Hornfel and {{e|Loki}}.
* Hornfel and Loki are brothers.<ref>https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1491311684144697345?t=HIqu902V3aUtJqXMP5Oz8A&s=19</ref>
* Hornfel is one of only 3 bosses that can be spared, with the others being {{e|Bumbino}} and {{e|Baby Plum}}.
** Coincidentally, they all made their debut in ''Repentance''.
** These three bosses all can drop extra additional items. In {{dlc|r+}} ''Repentance+'', only Hornfel was given a special 1% item drop as the other two were omitted.

